Downgrading is quite easy, one has to delete the existing Rcpp package and than download Rcpp 0.9.10 source: Rcpp_0.9.10.tar.gz <http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/Rcpp/Rcpp_0.9.10.tar.gz>
Once downloaded, the old Rcpp can be installed using standard package interface.

